Version 0.19.0 -- Copy Days
----------------------------
- NEW: Allow copying days in frontend
- CHG: restructure complete user flow of entering activities: users can edit, save and switch between days at will, save incomplete days, saving does not advance to next day anymore, study submission is separate from last day submission, ..., all of which are a consequence of the new copy days feature.
- DEV: Deleted and rewrote many of the E2E tests, wrote many new E2E tests. Also some integration tests changed.
- FIX: Fig bug #115, users could end study by navigating to last day and submitting even with previous days missing
- NEW: extend admin pages: add new edit zone, by default protected from accidental changes, user needs to unlock it by button press
- NEW: allow renaming study in admin edit zone (both name short and name)
- FIX: Make sure the app runs under MariaDB and MSSQL again, in addition to postgres



